# Egress allowlist for the code-worker forward-proxy (see tinyproxy.conf).
# POSIX extended regex, one per line, matched against the DESTINATION HOST.
# FilterDefaultDeny Yes means anything not matched here is refused.
#
# Shipped defaults cover the internal Convex function-allowlist proxy and the
# GitHub git remote. If your deployment uses a different git host or a hosted
# LLM endpoint, ADD its host below (e.g. `^api\.openai\.com$`) — otherwise the
# worker cannot reach it. Keep this list as tight as your setup allows.

# Convex function-allowlist proxy (internal service on the code-worker network).
^convex-fn-proxy$

# GitHub git remote (clone / push over HTTPS) — the default GIT_REPO_URL host.
^github\.com$
^api\.github\.com$
^codeload\.github\.com$

# LLM endpoint — uncomment / adjust to YOUR provider's host. Left commented so
# the allowlist ships closed; add exactly the host your LLM_BASE_URL uses.
# ^api\.openai\.com$
# ^ollama$
